### 1. Show all (Отримати всі книги)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/books
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Create one (Створити нову книгу)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/books
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "4",
  "title": "Clean Code",
  "author": "Robert Martin",
  "year": 2008
}

###

### 3. Read one (Отримати створену книгу за ID)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/books/4
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Update one (Оновити книгу)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/books
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "4",
  "title": "Clean Code (Updated)",
  "author": "Robert Martin",
  "year": 2010
}

###

### 5. Delete one (Видалити книгу за ID)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/books/4
Authorization: Basic admin admin